  <item>
    <title>年末圣诞礼互换，新年也能笑言欢，绝版特供小彩蛋，听听最初那一年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956650214db1df9efeb2591</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6956650214db1df9efeb2591</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 12:27:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 活动发起人老橙子与组织者老葡萄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 地狱礼物选送</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 天堂礼物选送</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a> 饭桶美学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">59:55</a> AI总结四个主播印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5680">01:34:40</a> &nbsp;彩蛋时间：412线上桌游</span></p><span></span><p><span>之前的线上桌游，当初剪掉的这两段。趁新年，作为彩蛋放在这一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>重新听到这段录音，感觉真的很奇妙。那时候大家还不熟，彼此之间礼貌又生疏，说话都带着试探。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果不是葡萄老师提议把它放出来，我估计也记不起来——原来我们最初相识的状态是这样的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如今再听，才更清楚地感受到这一年我们从陌生到熟悉，从拘谨到畅谈，友谊悄悄开出花。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音质虽渣，但时光无价。</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年之际，与你们分享这份‘最初’。</span></p><span></span><p><span>弄的挺好</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhd4N_GGNXBVsOecrAbSRB2Pe2Lb.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqkbroOXb6Za3Xi_GQF2-r4dG8OK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlR9Wvx8KkoxCh3M3TbjtZSqtAUT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKPnLqmO1Lp27y_T2fcClZ8ww9d.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeFT6UF_IRMLkct8INVhSGT6HsR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>责编：🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍇</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍊</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
