  <item>
    <title>难言之隐问问TA,掏出心窝儿全回答丨挤果汁儿一周年坦白局！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6931bc433fec3166cf516401</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6931bc433fec3166cf516401</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 00:06:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>挤果汁儿电台一周年之际，没想到本想庆祝的一期聊成了真心话坦白局</span></p><span></span><p><span>她当初录电台的初衷竟然是这个！？？</span></p><span></span><p><span>她对她竟然一直有意见！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>她忙着跟生活对线时，一回头，发现果汁儿这个家没了！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>尽管初衷不同，但我们的动机共同汇聚、阴差阳错地促成了电台的持续录制，用不同的养分共同浇灌出了一朵持续绽放的花</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>奇妙、庆幸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>共同的经历，比不同的起点更重要。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>无论原因是为了“挽回老友”还是“被鼓舞”，在一年的录制中</span></strong><strong><span>，这个电台本身已经超越了最初的动机</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 一个拍脑门儿的决定，没想到坚持了一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> &nbsp;佑子十年布局、匠心之作《挤果汁儿电台—起源》11月29日登录大荧幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 电台差点分崩离析的一集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> &nbsp;突然的深情时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> &nbsp;葡萄的担忧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> &nbsp;毛豆为橙子发声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">59:56</a> &nbsp;拷问橙子时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>责编：@🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：@🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：@🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍇</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍊</span></p>]]></description>
