    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e7e3b2525f51df38801088</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Oct 2025 19:44:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于，我们挤果汁儿回到了梦开始的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>“弄的挺好播客节！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>挤果汁儿诞生于一年前的第一届“弄的挺好播客节！”，时隔一年，当我们再次参与到这个活动里，体验感却大变样</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，远在澳洲的怀念先生，带着对传统广播和播客的热爱，看着热闹的现场图片，想想自己买了票却到不了场，已经馋的抓肝挠肺，于是对我们果汁儿进行了电话采访：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 橙子到现场的初印象是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> 各位有跟主播们是相互奔赴的感觉吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 佑子渡劫开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 现场录制内容的相关想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3586">59:46</a> &nbsp;为什么办这个播客节？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4385">01:13:05</a> 与群友们相见的美好瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5438">01:30:38</a> 欢迎加入我们这个朋友圈电台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5948">01:39:08</a> 比追星更有活人感的活动——“弄的挺好播客节！”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUqKso6UEoGYgM0ea90AfoGaSIW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>责编：🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持丨@怀念先生</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🥥</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🟡</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍇</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨@🍊</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片丨@Liana</span></p>]]></description>
