  <item>
    <title>汀灵灵！为您转接天台电话亭✨ ft.张store /小完</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d8eba8522b40626ca481e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d8eba8522b40626ca481e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Sep 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>特别鸣谢：『弄的挺好播客节』以及主办方</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62300e03df88d9797b67557e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62300e03df88d9797b67557e"><span>拍脑门儿</span></a><span>x优斯迪吧x安全出口FMx玲珑塔门市部x播客公社集结成「弄的挺好播客节」组委会</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客节现场，我们直接把“我也想弄”摊位升级成露天电话亭</span></p><span></span><p><span>金秋九月，浪漫天台，我们一起戴着耳机、吹着晚风，把童年漫游回耳边！</span></p><span></span><p><span>生拉硬拽“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62300e03df88d9797b67557e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62300e03df88d9797b67557e"><span>拍脑门儿</span></a><span>”主播张士多来串台，一开口就是老座机味了</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有姊妹电台“ </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/680242599530d259ce37da92" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/680242599530d259ce37da92"><span>新建窗口</span></a><span>”一起聊聊“打电话”这个事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 开场聊聊播客节现场氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 从张哥回忆小时候家里第一次接进电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 听到妈妈电话就会哭的幼儿小添</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 橙子同学现场自首：曾用座机点播动画片，一个月花掉爸妈半个月工资——这哪是点播，是点钞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 张哥竟是全国最早的“游戏主播”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 还跟女同学用电话亭COS“特工接头”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 彩蛋时间：“士多老妖”被薛哥“现场捉妖”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>现场的笑声被‘飞沙走石’扔到了什刹海！哪有什刹海没有什刹海（</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：《Weekend in Chinatown唐人街周末》 - 华裔美国熊</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>ED: &nbsp;&nbsp;《我出生的夏天》</span></em><span>-</span><em><span>普阿山/MoonJellies</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkJ0YmRwsHbiGZ2SNT1Wkxg9azdm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="http